{"content_text": "{\"protocolSection\":{\"identificationModule\":{\"nctId\":\"NCT01364363\",\"orgStudyIdInfo\":{\"id\":\"SIRB#13-6190\"},\"organization\":{\"fullName\":\"Scripps Health\",\"class\":\"OTHER\"},\"briefTitle\":\"Unrelated Donor Stem Cell Transplantation\",\"officialTitle\":\"Allogeneic Hematopoietic Progenitor Cell Transplantation From Unrelated Donors\"},\"statusModule\":{\"statusVerifiedDate\":\"2022-11\",\"overallStatus\":\"COMPLETED\",\"expandedAccessInfo\":{\"hasExpandedAccess\":false},\"startDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2005-03\"},\"primaryCompletionDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2015-07\",\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"},\"completionDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2015-07\",\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"},\"studyFirstSubmitDate\":\"2011-04-04\",\"studyFirstSubmitQcDate\":\"2011-06-01\",\"studyFirstPostDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2011-06-02\",\"type\":\"ESTIMATED\"},\"lastUpdateSubmitDate\":\"2022-11-21\",\"lastUpdatePostDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2022-11-23\",\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"}},\"sponsorCollaboratorsModule\":{\"responsibleParty\":{\"type\":\"SPONSOR\"},\"leadSponsor\":{\"name\":\"Scripps Health\",\"class\":\"OTHER\"}},\"oversightModule\":{\"oversightHasDmc\":false},\"descriptionModule\":{\"briefSummary\":\"The purpose of this study is to provide an opportunity for patients with malignancies or bone marrow failure states who lack a suitable sibling donor to undergo allogeneic hematopoietic progenitor cell transplantation using cells from unrelated individuals or cord blood registries.\",\"detailedDescription\":\"same\"},\"conditionsModule\":{\"conditions\":[\"Severe Aplastic Anemia\",\"Paroxysmal Nocturnal Hemoglobinuria\",\"Acute Myelogenous Leukemia\",\"Acute Lymphoblastic Leukemia\",\"Myelodysplastic Syndromes\",\"Myeloproliferative Syndromes\",\"Chronic Myelogenous Leukemia\",\"Hodgkin's Lymphoma\",\"Non-Hodgkin's Lymphoma\",\"Multiple Myeloma\",\"Chronic Lymphocytic Leukemia\",\"Small Lymphocytic Lymphoma\",\"Large Granulocytic Leukemia\"],\"keywords\":[\"Transplant\",\"Allogeneic\",\"Allogeneic transplant\",\"Unrelated donor transplant\",\"MUD\",\"HSCT\",\"Stem cell transplant\"]},\"designModule\":{\"studyType\":\"INTERVENTIONAL\",\"phases\":[\"NA\"],\"designInfo\":{\"allocation\":\"NON_RANDOMIZED\",\"interventionModel\":\"SINGLE_GROUP\",\"primaryPurpose\":\"TREATMENT\",\"maskingInfo\":{\"masking\":\"NONE\"}},\"enrollmentInfo\":{\"count\":64,\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"}},\"armsInterventionsModule\":{\"armGroups\":[{\"label\":\"Total Body Irradiation/VP16\",\"type\":\"OTHER\",\"description\":\"Acute Leukemias, Myelodysplastic syndromes\",\"interventionNames\":[\"Procedure: Allogeneic transplantation\"]},{\"label\":\"Cytoxan/Total Body Irradiation\",\"type\":\"OTHER\",\"description\":\"Chronic Leukemias, Bone Marrow Failure States, Lymphomas, Hodgkin's Disease\",\"interventionNames\":[\"Procedure: Allogeneic transplantation\"]},{\"label\":\"Busulfan/Cytoxan\",\"type\":\"OTHER\",\"description\":\"Acute Leukemia, Myelodysplastic syndromes, Chronic Leukemias, Bone Marrow Failure states\",\"interventionNames\":[\"Procedure: Allogeneic transplantation\"]},{\"label\":\"BEAM (BCNU, etoposide, Ara-C, melphalan)\",\"type\":\"OTHER\",\"description\":\"Lymphomas, Hodgkin's Disease\",\"interventionNames\":[\"Procedure: Allogeneic transplantation\"]},{\"label\":\"Total Lymphoid Irradiation\",\"type\":\"OTHER\",\"description\":\"For patients with Multiple Myeloma, or prior autologous transplantation, or age in excess of 55\",\"interventionNames\":[\"Procedure: Allogeneic transplantation\"]},{\"label\":\"Cladribine/Melphalan\",\"type\":\"OTHER\",\"description\":\"For patients with Multiple Myeloma, or prior autologous transplantation, or age in excess of 55\",\"interventionNames\":[\"Procedure: Allogeneic transplantation\"]},{\"label\":\"FLAG (fludarabine, Ara-C, G-CSF)\",\"type\":\"OTHER\",\"description\":\"For patients undergoing a second allogeneic transplant\",\"interventionNames\":[\"Procedure: Allogeneic transplantation\"]}],\"interventions\":[{\"type\":\"PROCEDURE\",\"name\":\"Allogeneic transplantation\",\"description\":\"Allogeneic transplantation with matched unrelated donors\",\"armGroupLabels\":[\"BEAM (BCNU, etoposide, Ara-C, melphalan)\",\"Busulfan/Cytoxan\",\"Cladribine/Melphalan\",\"Cytoxan/Total Body Irradiation\",\"FLAG (fludarabine, Ara-C, G-CSF)\",\"Total Body Irradiation/VP16\",\"Total Lymphoid Irradiation\"],\"otherNames\":[\"MUD transplant\"]}]},\"outcomesModule\":{\"primaryOutcomes\":[{\"measure\":\"Bone Marrow and Peripheral Blood Chimerism\",\"description\":\"Percent of donor and host cells in peripheral blood and bone marrow will be measured by short tandem repeat (STR) testing and/or standard cytogenetic testing.\",\"timeFrame\":\"30 days post-transplant\"},{\"measure\":\"Bone Marrow and Peripheral Blood Chimerism\",\"description\":\"Percent of donor and host cells in peripheral blood and bone marrow will be measured by short tandem repeat (STR) testing and/or standard cytogenetic testing.\",\"timeFrame\":\"100 days post-transplant\"},{\"measure\":\"Bone Marrow and Peripheral Blood Chimerism\",\"description\":\"Percent of donor and host cells in peripheral blood and bone marrow will be measured by short tandem repeat (STR) testing and/or standard cytogenetic testing.\",\"timeFrame\":\"365 days post-transplant\"}]},\"eligibilityModule\":{\"eligibilityCriteria\":\"Inclusion Criteria:\\n\\n* \\\\> 18 years of Age\\n* \\\\< 70 years\\n* ECOG performance status 0, 1 or 2\\n* Left Ventricular Ejection Fraction \\\\> 30%\\n* Creatinine clearance \\\\> 40ml/min\\n* Transaminases \\\\< 2X normal\\n* Total bilirubin \\\\< 2X normal\\n* HIV seronegativity\\n* Weight \\\\< 70kg for cord blood transplantation\\n* Ability to cover the cost of the transplant, necessary medications, and transportation/housing.\\n* Caregiver must be available while outpatient\\n\\nExclusion Criteria:\\n\\n* Greater than one antigen mismatch at HLA-A, B, C or DR plus one allele mismatch at HLA-A, B, C or DR\",\"healthyVolunteers\":false,\"sex\":\"ALL\",\"minimumAge\":\"18 Years\",\"maximumAge\":\"69 Years\",\"stdAges\":[\"ADULT\",\"OLDER_ADULT\"]},\"contactsLocationsModule\":{\"overallOfficials\":[{\"name\":\"Jeffrey W. Andrey, MD\",\"affiliation\":\"Scripps Clinic Medical Group\",\"role\":\"PRINCIPAL_INVESTIGATOR\"}],\"locations\":[{\"facility\":\"Scripps Green Hospital\",\"city\":\"La Jolla\",\"state\":\"California\",\"zip\":\"92037\",\"country\":\"United States\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":32.84727,\"lon\":-117.2742}}]}},\"derivedSection\":{\"miscInfoModule\":{\"versionHolder\":\"2026-09-18\"},\"conditionBrowseModule\":{\"meshes\":[{\"id\":\"D000741\",\"term\":\"Anemia, Aplastic\"},{\"id\":\"D006457\",\"term\":\"Hemoglobinuria, Paroxysmal\"},{\"id\":\"D015470\",\"term\":\"Leukemia, Myeloid, Acute\"},{\"id\":\"D054198\",\"term\":\"Precursor Cell Lymphoblastic Leukemia-Lymphoma\"},{\"id\":\"D009190\",\"term\":\"Myelodysplastic Syndromes\"},{\"id\":\"D015464\",\"term\":\"Leukemia, Myelogenous, Chronic, BCR-ABL Positive\"},{\"id\":\"D006689\",\"term\":\"Hodgkin Disease\"},{\"id\":\"D008228\",\"term\":\"Lymphoma, Non-Hodgkin\"},{\"id\":\"D009101\",\"term\":\"Multiple Myeloma\"},{\"id\":\"D015451\",\"term\":\"Leukemia, Lymphocytic, Chronic, B-Cell\"}],\"ancestors\":[{\"id\":\"D000740\",\"term\":\"Anemia\"},{\"id\":\"D006402\",\"term\":\"Hematologic Diseases\"},{\"id\":\"D006425\",\"term\":\"Hemic and Lymphatic Diseases\"},{\"id\":\"D000080983\",\"term\":\"Bone Marrow Failure Disorders\"},{\"id\":\"D001855\",\"term\":\"Bone Marrow Diseases\"},{\"id\":\"D000743\",\"term\":\"Anemia, Hemolytic\"},{\"id\":\"D007951\",\"term\":\"Leukemia, Myeloid\"},{\"id\":\"D007938\",\"term\":\"Leukemia\"},{\"id\":\"D009370\",\"term\":\"Neoplasms by Histologic Type\"},{\"id\":\"D009369\",\"term\":\"Neoplasms\"},{\"id\":\"D007945\",\"term\":\"Leukemia, Lymphoid\"},{\"id\":\"D008232\",\"term\":\"Lymphoproliferative Disorders\"},{\"id\":\"D008206\",\"term\":\"Lymphatic Diseases\"},{\"id\":\"D007160\",\"term\":\"Immunoproliferative Disorders\"},{\"id\":\"D007154\",\"term\":\"Immune System Diseases\"},{\"id\":\"D009196\",\"term\":\"Myeloproliferative Disorders\"},{\"id\":\"D002908\",\"term\":\"Chronic Disease\"},{\"id\":\"D020969\",\"term\":\"Disease Attributes\"},{\"id\":\"D010335\",\"term\":\"Pathologic Processes\"},{\"id\":\"D013568\",\"term\":\"Pathological Conditions, Signs and Symptoms\"},{\"id\":\"D008223\",\"term\":\"Lymphoma\"},{\"id\":\"D054219\",\"term\":\"Neoplasms, Plasma Cell\"},{\"id\":\"D020141\",\"term\":\"Hemostatic Disorders\"},{\"id\":\"D014652\",\"term\":\"Vascular Diseases\"},{\"id\":\"D002318\",\"term\":\"Cardiovascular Diseases\"},{\"id\":\"D010265\",\"term\":\"Paraproteinemias\"},{\"id\":\"D001796\",\"term\":\"Blood Protein Disorders\"},{\"id\":\"D006474\",\"term\":\"Hemorrhagic Disorders\"},{\"id\":\"D015448\",\"term\":\"Leukemia, B-Cell\"}]},\"interventionBrowseModule\":{\"meshes\":[{\"id\":\"D014184\",\"term\":\"Transplantation, Homologous\"}],\"ancestors\":[{\"id\":\"D014180\",\"term\":\"Transplantation\"},{\"id\":\"D013514\",\"term\":\"Surgical Procedures, Operative\"}]}},\"hasResults\":false}", "media_type": "application/json", "text_derivation": {"extractor_version": "stdlib-json-object-slice-v1", "method": "ctgov-study-json-v1", "raw_asset": {"byte_size": 551685, "media_type": "application/json", "relative_path": "evidence/raw/sha256/f3/f310b92adcd3f27a67912ffc2e81f6019350e59f47df9325b10409bbee555f19.bin", "sha256": "f310b92adcd3f27a67912ffc2e81f6019350e59f47df9325b10409bbee555f19"}, "record_selector": {"nct_id": "NCT01364363", "study_index": 9}, "schema_version": "1.0", "text_sha256": "8fe4f1f83b940e2e223940ac99ec39e4832fdc6e318ecb24a22ab7789e31fb26"}}